  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt = int(input())\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    N = 3 * n \r\n    \r\n    pref =[0]*(N+1)\r\n    for i in range(N):\r\n        pref[i+1] = pref[i]+a[i]\r\n        \r\n    ans = 0\r\n    \r\n    for A in range(n+1):\r\n        lo = 0\r\n        hi = n - A \r\n        \r\n        \r\n        while lo<hi:\r\n            B = (lo+hi)//2\r\n            \r\n            J= A+2*B \r\n            K = N-2*A-B\r\n            \r\n            \r\n            diff = -3 *a[K-1]+a[J]+a[J+1]\r\n            \r\n            if diff>0:\r\n                lo=B+1 \r\n            else:\r\n                hi = B \r\n        B=lo \r\n        J=A+2*B \r\n        K=N-2*A-B\r\n        \r\n        current = 3*pref[K]+2 * pref[A]+pref[J]\r\n        ans = max(ans, current)\r\n        \r\n    print(ans)",
